# a3's end save: the Manda ruin hall (ST12 sub 0, story 4). God mode (docs/playthrough.md): the boss fights and the
# small enemies are cleared with the Shining Laser (r2 lock-on + triangle). No blue card is needed to reach ST13:
# the hall's exit 0 -> the long room ST12 sub 1 -> its door actor (static type 0x19 at (-3584, -192, -6144); kind-0
# doors open only for a player standing still, facing them, pressing circle) -> ST13 sub 0.
# Classic controls: the d-pad strafes relative to the facing (+0x2a), l1 / r1 turn (accelerating), so the jumps out
# of the trenches (hold DIR+cross) and the turns before doors / event volumes (hold l1|r1 N) are fixed for this run.
# ---- ST12 sub 0 (hall) -> sub 1 -> ST13 sub 0
exit 0 use
go 1536 6000 48
go 1536 3650 48
hold left+cross 25
go -1536 3050 48
go -1536 -300 48
hold left+cross 25
go -3584 -1000 48
go -3584 -4400 48
hold left+cross 25
go -3584 -6000 48
go -3584 -6195 16
hold l1 26
wait 6
wait 10
tap circle
wait 8
tap circle
wait 8
tap circle
wait 8
tap circle
wait 8
until 13 0 - 300
calm
